# Title: PowerShell Script Change Permission Via Set-Acl
# ID: bdeb2cff-af74-4094-8426-724dc937f20a
# Status: test
# Level: high
# Author: Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems)
# Date: 2022-10-18
# Tags: attack.stealth
# Description: Detects PowerShell execution to set the ACL of a file or a folder
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(((process.command_line:*Set-Acl * AND process.command_line:*-AclObject * AND process.command_line:*-Path *)) AND (((process.pe.original_file_name:"PowerShell.EXE" OR process.pe.original_file_name:"pwsh.dll")) OR ((process.executable:*\\powershell.exe OR process.executable:*\\pwsh.exe))))
